{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Welcome to Autumn's Dungeoneering!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let's get you oriented. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/cd2f73e8bd8d966eb6b3f6e8f53cc9f9.poster.avif?t=1761717716\" width=164 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/cd2f73e8bd8d966eb6b3f6e8f53cc9f9.webm?t=1761717716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You aren\u2019t the hero in this RPG dungeon crawler. You are disposable, obedient, and just self-aware enough to realize how unfair that is.\u00a0Congratulations on your sentience. It won\u2019t help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your Summoner:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/a4b20b491b542bb68f7378aaab2a57ac.poster.avif?t=1761717716\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/a4b20b491b542bb68f7378aaab2a57ac.webm?t=1761717716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet your new boss: slow, methodical, and pathologically obsessed with grinding the same area forever. What she lacks in speed, she makes up for in your pain tolerance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Personality System </strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Saki runs on an advanced behavioral algorithm that perfectly mimics an adventurer with free will and no empathy. She has opinions. Most of them involve you doing the hard part.\u00a0 If she dies, she blames you. Truly the pinnacle of being an imp. The ultimate escort mission. It never ends, you can't escape and your death means nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/f670c9c3a611deb9a48c8997e6e6c775.avif?t=1761717716\" width=1016 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Relationship</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices shape how much she tolerates you. The more she likes you, the more effective you become. Try to behave. She controls your respawn timer and technically your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The World of Xanrea</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything plays out in Xanrea, a world where elements are worshiped, a ninja is queen, and minions get volunteered for every catastrophic idea in history. If that sounds lovely, check out our other options. Such as books, Discord, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game may include, but is not limited to a snarky, possibly sentient AI adventurer, a very passive aggressive merchant. A bunch of self entitled enemies with attitude, and you (probably the worst of the lot).\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403760?t=1761717716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403760?t=1761717716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/548c5fc5e14a9c4612297751a828c3cbc1633a18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761717716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/548c5fc5e14a9c4612297751a828c3cbc1633a18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761717716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3404230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Welcome to Autumn's Dungeoneering!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let's get you oriented. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/cd2f73e8bd8d966eb6b3f6e8f53cc9f9.poster.avif?t=1761717716\" width=164 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/cd2f73e8bd8d966eb6b3f6e8f53cc9f9.webm?t=1761717716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You aren\u2019t the hero in this RPG dungeon crawler. You are disposable, obedient, and just self-aware enough to realize how unfair that is.\u00a0Congratulations on your sentience. It won\u2019t help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your Summoner:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/a4b20b491b542bb68f7378aaab2a57ac.poster.avif?t=1761717716\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/a4b20b491b542bb68f7378aaab2a57ac.webm?t=1761717716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet your new boss: slow, methodical, and pathologically obsessed with grinding the same area forever. What she lacks in speed, she makes up for in your pain tolerance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Personality System </strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Saki runs on an advanced behavioral algorithm that perfectly mimics an adventurer with free will and no empathy. She has opinions. Most of them involve you doing the hard part.\u00a0 If she dies, she blames you. Truly the pinnacle of being an imp. The ultimate escort mission. It never ends, you can't escape and your death means nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/extras/f670c9c3a611deb9a48c8997e6e6c775.avif?t=1761717716\" width=1016 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Relationship</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices shape how much she tolerates you. The more she likes you, the more effective you become. Try to behave. She controls your respawn timer and technically your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The World of Xanrea</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything plays out in Xanrea, a world where elements are worshiped, a ninja is queen, and minions get volunteered for every catastrophic idea in history. If that sounds lovely, check out our other options. Such as books, Discord, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game may include, but is not limited to a snarky, possibly sentient AI adventurer, a very passive aggressive merchant. A bunch of self entitled enemies with attitude, and you (probably the worst of the lot).\u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["Purple Xanmal"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403760/fec5e62689e7a088fed838845c620c0cc1be6d41/header.jpg?t=1761717716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Autumn's Dungeoneering","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li>